### Library Book Management System - REST API Test Requests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Get Dashboard Statistics (Initial empty or existing state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/stats
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Add Sample Book 1 (Wings of Fire - AVAILABLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK101",
  "title": "Wings of Fire",
  "author": "A.P.J. Abdul Kalam",
  "category": "Biography",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 4. Add Sample Book 2 (The Alchemist - ISSUED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK102",
  "title": "The Alchemist",
  "author": "Paulo Coelho",
  "category": "Fiction",
  "status": "ISSUED"
}

###

### 5. Add Sample Book 3 (Introduction to Algorithms - AVAILABLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK103",
  "title": "Introduction to Algorithms",
  "author": "Thomas H. Cormen",
  "category": "Technology",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 6. Add Sample Book 4 (A Brief History of Time - AVAILABLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK104",
  "title": "A Brief History of Time",
  "author": "Stephen Hawking",
  "category": "Science",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 7. Add Sample Book 5 (The Discovery of India - ISSUED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK105",
  "title": "The Discovery of India",
  "author": "Jawaharlal Nehru",
  "category": "History",
  "status": "ISSUED"
}

###

### 8. Test Duplicate Book ID (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK101",
  "title": "Duplicate Book Test",
  "author": "Someone",
  "category": "Fiction",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 9. Test Invalid Input / Empty Title (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "BK999",
  "title": "",
  "author": "Anonymous",
  "category": "Fiction",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 10. Get Book by ID (Assuming ID 1 exists)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Search Books by Title or Author Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search?query=Algorithms
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Search Books by Author Keyword (Case-Insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search?query=kalam
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Update Book Details (Keep Book ID fixed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wings of Fire (Special Edition)",
  "author": "Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam & Arun Tiwari",
  "category": "Biography",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 14. Change Book Status to ISSUED (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ISSUED"
}

###

### 15. Change Book Status back to AVAILABLE (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### 16. Verify Updated Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/stats
Accept: application/json

###

### 17. Delete a Book Record (Assuming ID 5 exists)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/5

###

### 18. Verify 404 on Non-Existent Book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99999
Accept: application/json

